WEBVTT

00:03:27.722 --> 00:03:30.110
Na hapa ni sababu ya tatu:

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:33.742
UNESCO ilisema kuwa mwakani 2025,

00:03:33.742 --> 00:03:36.970
wanafunzi milioni mia moja

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:39.400
watanyimwa elimu ya juu

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:43.211
kwa sababu tu, ya kutokua na viti tosha

00:03:43.211 --> 00:03:46.338
kuwapa malazi, kukidhi mahitaji.

00:03:46.338 --> 00:03:47.600
Watafanya mtihani wa usajili,

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.355
wataupita,

00:03:49.355 --> 00:03:51.748
lakini bado hawatapata kuingia

00:03:51.748 --> 00:03:55.416
kwa sababu hakuna nafasi zilizoko

00:03:55.416 --> 00:03:57.320
Hizi ndizo sababu

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.808
Nilianzisha Chuo kikuu cha watu,

00:03:59.808 --> 00:04:02.832
si cha faida, na bila malezi,